Sky metal is metal thought to be blessed upon [[Geography/Færrin/index|Færrin]] by the Outer Gods or by other powerful beings. [[Geography/Færrin/Infinite Horizon/The Quorum/The Quorum Building|The Quorum]] on the [[Geography/Færrin/Infinite Horizon/The Quorum/index|Joker World at Star 221,325]] is built of a black sky metal, reflective and formed at least in part by magic.

Elsewhere in the [[Geography/Astra|Astra]] it is called starmetal: any metal imbued with magical properties. That name is a misnomer. Ancient astergraphs believed the metals were produced by celestial bodies as a boon for those that orbited them, but starmetals have since been manufactured by introducing high quantities of [[Phenomena/Manifestation|mana]] into mundane metals. Each starmetal has its own properties, and they are sought after for both jewelry and armament manufacture.
